## Commit slices (suggested)

| # | Type | Scope | Approx files |
|---|------|-------|--------------|
| 1 | `chore:` | jotai add, zustand remove, Provider only | 2 + doc |
| 2 | `feat:` | theme atoms + ThemeContext removal | 2–3 + doc |
| 3 | `feat:` | auth atoms + useAuth hook | 2 + doc |
| 4 | `feat:` | authActions + AuthInitializer + AuthContext removal | 3 + doc |
