## Risks and mitigations

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| OAuth regression | Phase 3 doc includes step-by-step manual test; port logic verbatim first |
| Theme flash on launch | Document AsyncStorage hydration; default theme until load completes (same as today) |
| Over-migrating server state | Rule: no imports of `useBlogs` logic into atoms |
| Learning docs skipped | **Block merge/commit** until doc exists for the slice (this rule) |

---

## Definition of done

- [ ] No `ThemeProvider` / `AuthProvider` in `App.tsx`
- [ ] `useTheme()` / `useAuth()` APIs unchanged for consumers
- [ ] React Query hooks untouched
- [ ] All docs listed in [Doc naming convention](#doc-naming-convention) exist and are complete
- [ ] Auth + theme manual tests pass
- [ ] `zustand` removed from dependencies

---

## When working on this migration

1. Read this rule first.
2. Implement **one phase** (or sub-slice) only.
3. Write the **doc before asking to commit**.
4. Do not start Phase N+1 until Phase N is verified and committed (with user approval).
